form point
  case make
    link x, like u64
    link y, like u64

  wear arithmetic
    task add-points
      take a, like u64
      take b, like u64
      back call add
        bind a, read a
        bind b, read b

  wear comparison
    task points-equal
      take a, like u64
      take b, like u64
      back call eq
        bind a, read a
        bind b, read b
